<title>USA: Equity Corp to start trading on NYSE.</title>
<headline>Equity Corp to start trading on NYSE.</headline>
<dateline>LUFKIN, Texas 1997-05-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Equity Corp International, currently trading its common stock on the Nasdaq National Market under the symbol &quot;ECII&quot;, will trade on the New York Stock Exchange from June 6 1997 under the symbol &quot;EQU&quot;.</p>
<p>The death care company began operations in May 1990 and currently owns and operates funeral homes and cemeteries in 27 states and one Canadian province.</p>
